WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Maybe we'll start over here.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Would any of you like to say something?

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.800
Feel free.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.880
You can say it in front of a fine group of people,

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.400
also journalists and reporters.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.040
Would you want to start?

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.540
Sure.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.040
Go ahead.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:14.920
Absolutely.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.120
President Trump, members of the cabinet,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.600
really appreciate you guys bringing this together.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.200
And the fact that we are here today and on such short notice

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.240
shows how serious you guys are taking

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.840
this issue of trans-terrorists and, frankly,

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.080
the cities and police departments

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.480
that are cooperating with Antifa, such as Portland.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.680
I mean, the Portland politicians are literally

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.480
willing to sacrifice their own citizens just

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.520
to appease these Antifa terrorists.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.040
It's sickening.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:50.560
I've seen it firsthand, obviously.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:54.599
When I went to jail that night, never expected it to happen.

00:00:54.599 --> 00:00:57.759
I thought that they were maybe removing me for my own safety.

00:00:57.759 --> 00:00:59.840
It never crossed my mind that I was

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.919
the one that was being arrested for a crime

00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:04.639
after I was just thrown into a hole.

00:01:04.639 --> 00:01:06.800
I heard from the Department of Homeland Security

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.400
after I had gotten out of jail, and one of your,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.639
I won't say exactly who it was, but somebody very close

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:15.199
to Secretary Noem over here, said

00:01:15.199 --> 00:01:17.680
that they were legitimately worried for my safety

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.000
in the Portland jail.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.800
But luckily, the Portland jail was,

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:22.379
I was the only one there, essentially,

00:01:22.379 --> 00:01:24.139
because they don't actually arrest people

00:01:24.139 --> 00:01:26.699
in Portland, besides conservative journalists,

00:01:26.699 --> 00:01:27.620
I guess.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:31.980
So look, I'm glad that it was not a good night for me.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:32.779
Let's just say that.

00:01:32.779 --> 00:01:35.220
It was not fun sitting in that jail.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:38.139
But I'm glad to see what has come of it.

00:01:38.139 --> 00:01:42.779
And I've been able to talk to a bunch of FBI agents,

00:01:42.779 --> 00:01:46.739
ATF agents, DHS agents that I didn't even

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:50.580
know existed until I went there and went to that ICE facility.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.300
And the morale is at an all-time high.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:58.500
It is so exciting to see these guys know now

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:03.019
that they have the backing of the Secretary, the DOJ,

00:02:03.019 --> 00:02:05.019
as well as the President of the United States.

00:02:05.019 --> 00:02:07.139
And they are there to do their job.

00:02:07.139 --> 00:02:09.339
They are going to fulfill this mission

00:02:09.339 --> 00:02:12.339
and deport these violent criminals.

00:02:12.339 --> 00:02:15.339
I believe one of the ones that I did a ride along with Secretary

00:02:15.339 --> 00:02:17.419
Noem yesterday, President Trump, and there

00:02:17.419 --> 00:02:21.660
was a pedophile that had come into the country five times

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.500
over the past seven years.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.380
Seven years.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.940
And apparently under the Biden regime,

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.259
that was just allowed to happen.

00:02:29.259 --> 00:02:29.899
That was fine.

00:02:29.899 --> 00:02:31.380
No problem.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.059
It's concerning to me that you're

00:02:33.059 --> 00:02:35.740
seeing the Portland Police Department, as well

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:39.100
as the governor of Oregon, and the mayor, of course,

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:42.100
coming out and running defense for pedophiles

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.339
that have entered the country illegally five times.

00:02:44.339 --> 00:02:46.179
It's crazy.

00:02:46.179 --> 00:02:50.460
I'm glad it's taking a front row seat in the media.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.740
And they're being forced to talk about it in reality,

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.979
because we are the ones that were on the ground.

00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:58.940
We're the ones that are actually reporting what's going on.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:03.059
And much of the legacy media has been either ignoring it

00:03:03.059 --> 00:03:06.660
or covering for Antifa for years now.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:11.139
So thank you guys so much for taking this seriously.

00:03:11.139 --> 00:03:14.139
And President Trump, you mentioned that flag.

00:03:14.139 --> 00:03:20.779
Remember, you put out a truth right after I took this flag

00:03:20.779 --> 00:03:23.419
from that man that was burning it in the street.

00:03:23.419 --> 00:03:24.460
Do you know who he is?

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:24.979
Oh, yeah.

00:03:24.979 --> 00:03:26.059
I know exactly who it is.

00:03:26.059 --> 00:03:29.339
So why don't you give it to Pam, give it to the attorney general,

00:03:29.339 --> 00:03:32.220
and let's start prosecutions.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.699
Yeah.

00:03:32.699 --> 00:03:35.179
I actually have a second flag that he tried to burn, as well.

00:03:35.179 --> 00:03:36.500
So I have two of them from the same guy.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.179
Well, you also saw what happened when that flag started burning.

00:03:39.179 --> 00:03:40.339
Everyone went crazy.

00:03:40.339 --> 00:03:42.860
And that's when it started, when they started burning the flag.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:43.619
So thank you.

00:03:43.619 --> 00:03:44.979
If you could give the information,

00:03:44.979 --> 00:03:45.660
it would be great.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.179
Absolutely.

00:03:46.179 --> 00:03:48.699
And at least that horrible night made you famous.

00:03:48.699 --> 00:03:50.940
He was already famous.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.179
I got a text from the president of the United States,

00:03:53.179 --> 00:03:54.179
so I appreciate that.

00:03:54.179 --> 00:03:56.259
And President Trump, after that happened to Nick,

00:03:56.259 --> 00:03:57.460
I called Harmeet Dhillon.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.220
And we opened a pattern and practice investigation

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.500
into the Portland police, very publicly,

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.660
as to how they let this happen.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.740
Thank you, sir.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:08.820
Mr. President, you're going to, Brandi Cruz,

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.899
you're going to hear us be very fired up today.

00:04:10.899 --> 00:04:11.539
And you can tell.

00:04:11.539 --> 00:04:13.779
And it's because some of us have been covering Antifa

00:04:13.779 --> 00:04:16.220
for 15 years and have never had anyone

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.140
in a position of authority even acknowledge their existence.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.459
I'll also tell you that I think that, had you not done,

00:04:22.459 --> 00:04:23.980
the single most powerful thing you've

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.459
done to deal with this scourge has been acknowledging

00:04:26.459 --> 00:04:28.260
that Antifa is a real thing.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.299
I genuinely believe there would be people at these tables who

00:04:31.299 --> 00:04:34.899
would be dead today and would have been killed in Portland,

00:04:34.899 --> 00:04:36.899
had you not called them a terror organization

00:04:36.899 --> 00:04:38.820
and said, we're going to bring the full weight

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.579
of the federal government to bear.

00:04:40.579 --> 00:04:43.140
I talked to Katie Davis Court in Portland the other day.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:44.660
She'd been assaulted all summer.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:45.859
And she said the same thing.

00:04:45.859 --> 00:04:48.459
They didn't see him as quick to violence as soon

00:04:48.459 --> 00:04:50.100
as you made that designation.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.420
So they're thinking in their heads.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.140
They're worried.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.420
There's been two dozen or so arrested in Portland.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.100
They don't want to go to federal prison.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.019
There's this video of them, one of them

00:04:58.019 --> 00:05:00.299
who was in the face of an ICE agent.

00:05:00.299 --> 00:05:03.179
And then he's in custody shaking.

00:05:03.179 --> 00:05:07.019
Once you take the mask off, they're nothing.

00:05:07.019 --> 00:05:09.859
I was told by probably a dozen people

00:05:09.859 --> 00:05:11.179
not to tell you this.

00:05:11.179 --> 00:05:12.619
I'm going to tell it to you anyway,

00:05:12.619 --> 00:05:15.299
because it's relevant to what we're talking about.

00:05:15.299 --> 00:05:18.220
I'm living proof that you can recover from TDS.

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:23.220
I had strong Trump derangement syndrome for probably

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.980
eight years.

